d be  proud but they would totally feel like  they did not deserve all of this  recognition a piece of american history  once largely lost  well worth recognizing  and remembering for cbs mornings i'm  chris van cleave in st louis  nicely done chris van cleef talk about  an uphill battle yeah they persisted and  persevered and the courage involved in  that day and age because if you lose  it's a real bad scene it already is yeah  you speak on the odds being stacked  against you you walk into a courtroom  you're not supposed to be able to read  or write  a courtroom full of all white men in a  slave state but like he said the truth  is powerful yeah powerful yeah you're  not even viewed as a human being back  yeah about that
 

